---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Start a Conversation | Free 20-Min Google Meet | Pikes Peak Web Designs"
description: "A 20-minute call on Google Meet with Jon. No pressure, no deposit. Tell me about your business and what you would like your site to do."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Start a Conversation</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="section-label">Let's talk</span>
    <h1>Tell me about <em>your business.</em></h1>
    <p>A 20-minute call on Google Meet. Nothing to pay, nothing to sign. The fastest way to start is the form below; if it does not fit your situation, call, text, or email instead.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="section-label">Form first</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="max-width:24ch">Send the form. It is the fastest way to start.</h2>
        <p>The discovery-call form routes straight to me, the person who will run the call. I read every submission and reply within one business day. Most clients prefer the form because they can think before they write, and I get the context to give a useful first reply.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:2rem;padding:1.75rem;background:var(--bg-alt);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius)">
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1rem">What happens next</h3>
          <ol style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.85rem">
            <li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0.85rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6">
              <span style="width:28px;height:28px;background:var(--navy-900);color:var(--gold-400);border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem">1</span>
              <span>I read your form and reply within one business day.</span>
            </li>
            <li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0.85rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6">
              <span style="width:28px;height:28px;background:var(--navy-900);color:var(--gold-400);border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem">2</span>
              <span>We schedule a 20-minute discovery call on Google Meet (just you and me).</span>
            </li>
            <li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0.85rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6">
              <span style="width:28px;height:28px;background:var(--navy-900);color:var(--gold-400);border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem">3</span>
              <span>If I am the right fit, you sign a simple agreement and I start building.</span>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:2rem;padding:1.5rem 1.75rem;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius)">
          <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:0.85rem">If the form does not suit you</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:1rem">Reach me directly. All three lines hit me; the discovery-call form is faster, but these are always open.</p>
          <ul style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.55rem;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.5">
            <li><strong>Call or text</strong> &middot; <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}" class="inline-link">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a> &middot; Mon&ndash;Fri 8am&ndash;6pm MT</li>
            <li><strong>Email</strong> &middot; <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="inline-link">{{ site.email }}</a> &middot; Reply within one business day</li>
            <li><strong>Just a quick question?</strong> &middot; <a href="/ask/" class="inline-link">Use the short ask form</a> &middot; Three fields, same inbox</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-form-card">
        <h2 class="form-heading">Send me a message</h2>
        <p class="form-intro">Fill out the form and I will be in touch within one business day.</p>

        <form id="contactForm" data-web3forms data-redirect="/thank-you/" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="form">
          <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="b6c3454b-f07c-43f7-9070-0e0cb5286f55">
          <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New contact, Pikes Peak Web Designs">
          <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Pikes Peak Web Designs">
          <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="firstName">First name <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="firstName" name="firstName" placeholder="Jane" required autocomplete="given-name">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="lastName">Last name <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="lastName" name="lastName" placeholder="Smith" required autocomplete="family-name">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="businessName">Business name <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="businessName" name="businessName" placeholder="Smith's Roofing Co." required autocomplete="organization">
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email <span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="jane@yourbusiness.com" required autocomplete="email">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="(555) 123-4567" autocomplete="tel">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="currentSite">Do you currently have a website?</label>
            <select id="currentSite" name="currentSite">
              <option value="">Choose one…</option>
              <option value="none">No; I need one built from scratch</option>
              <option value="wordpress">Yes; it's on WordPress</option>
              <option value="builder">Yes; Wix, Squarespace, or similar</option>
              <option value="custom">Yes; it's a custom site</option>
              <option value="other">Yes (something else)</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">Tell me about your business <span class="req">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="What does your business do? What would you like your new site to do for you? Any specific concerns or goals?" required></textarea>
          </div>

          <div id="form-error" role="alert" class="form-error">
            Something went wrong. Please try again or email me directly at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.
          </div>

          <button type="submit" id="contactSubmit" class="btn btn-primary btn-full btn-lg">Send message</button>
          <p class="form-hint">We respect your privacy. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="inline-link">privacy policy</a>.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

